      "*": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><blockquote><p>\"<i>When things don't work out...well can't do much about that!</i>\"<br />— Tia, <i><a href=\"/wiki/Potion_Maker\" title=\"Potion Maker\">Potion Maker</a></i></p></blockquote><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-stacked\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Tia (티아) <span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Characters\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/potionmaker/images/3/36/Characters.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20150527022122\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"16\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Characters.png\" data-image-key=\"Characters.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></span></span></h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/potionmaker/images/0/07/Tia.png/revision/latest?cb=20150627203328\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Tia\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/potionmaker/images/0/07/Tia.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20150627203328\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/potionmaker/images/0/07/Tia.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20150627203328 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/potionmaker/images/0/07/Tia.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/536?cb=20150627203328 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Tia\" width=\"270\" height=\"251\" data-image-key=\"Tia.png\" data-image-name=\"Tia.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"name\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Name</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Tia (티아)</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"gender\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Gender</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Female</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"age\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Age</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">17; Confirmed younger than <a href=\"/wiki/Pio\" title=\"Pio\">Pio</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"height\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Height</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">159 cm</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"series\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Series</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><i><a href=\"/wiki/Potion_Maker\" title=\"Potion Maker\">Potion Maker</a></i></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"occup\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Occupation</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Potion tradesman (pommelier in training)</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"species\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Species</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Demon</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"firstintroduced\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Introduced In</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><i><a href=\"/wiki/Potion_Maker\" title=\"Potion Maker\">Potion Maker</a></i></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"lastseen\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Last Appearance</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Ongoing</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Tia</b> is the second protagonist of <i><a href=\"/wiki/Potion_Maker\" title=\"Potion Maker\">Potion Maker</a></i>. She is unlocked after obtaining 20 stars.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Character\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Character</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Interactions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Interactions</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Dialogues\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Dialogues</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Intro_Transcript\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Intro Transcript</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Character\">Character</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpotionmaker.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FTia%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/potionmaker/images/c/cc/Tia_info.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20150527020914\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Information on Tia.\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/potionmaker/images/c/cc/Tia_info.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20150527020914\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"98\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Tia info.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Tia_info.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Tia_info.jpg\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">Information on Tia.</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p>Tia has an assertive personality. During potion creation, she will often look deterministically at the player. She was sent from the kingdom palace to work with <a href=\"/wiki/Pio\" title=\"Pio\">Pio</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Interactions\">Interactions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpotionmaker.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FTia%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Tapping on her will cause her to wince in pain, or bounce back. Swiping so that she is stroked will satisfy her. Touching on her bust will cause her to blush, and she may remark, \"Pervert!\" or \"How dare you!\"\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Dialogues\">Dialogues</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpotionmaker.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FTia%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>See <a href=\"/wiki/Tia/dialogues\" title=\"Tia/dialogues\">Tia's dialogues</a>.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Intro_Transcript\">Intro Transcript</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpotionmaker.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FTia%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table style=\"background-color: #e0f1c6; border: 1px solid #cfdbbd; margin: 8px 0; padding: 10px;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><div align=\"center\">- One night after a day of sales -</div>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><span><img alt=\"TiaWho\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/potionmaker/images/6/60/TiaWho.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/64?cb=20150527011411\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"TiaWho.png\" data-image-key=\"TiaWho.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></span><figcaption></figcaption></figure>Really. Why is an elite like me in a place like this..<br />I don't get it!<div style=\"clear:both; margin:0; padding:0;\"></div>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><span><img alt=\"TiaWho\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"TiaWho.png\" data-image-key=\"TiaWho.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/potionmaker/images/6/60/TiaWho.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/64?cb=20150527011411\" /></span><figcaption></figcaption></figure>Knock knock- Hello?<div style=\"clear:both; margin:0; padding:0;\"></div>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/Pio\" title=\"Pio\"><img alt=\"PiaDialogue\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"PiaDialogue.png\" data-image-key=\"PiaDialogue.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/potionmaker/images/6/67/PiaDialogue.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/64?cb=20150527013007\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure> Oh, terribly sorry. Sales are close for toda..<sup><abbr title=\"The preceding text has been transcribed exactly as presented in the original source.\" style=\"border-bottom: 1px dotted; cursor: help;\">&#91;<i>sic</i>&#93;</abbr></sup><div style=\"clear:both; margin:0; padding:0;\"></div>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/Tia\" title=\"Tia\"><img alt=\"TiaDialogue\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"TiaDialogue.png\" data-image-key=\"TiaDialogue.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/potionmaker/images/8/8f/TiaDialogue.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/64?cb=20150527013536\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>Huh? Oh no. I'm not here to buy. Hmm.. may I speak to your parents?<div style=\"clear:both; margin:0; padding:0;\"></div>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/Pio\" title=\"Pio\"><img alt=\"PiaDialogue\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"PiaDialogue.png\" data-image-key=\"PiaDialogue.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/potionmaker/images/6/67/PiaDialogue.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/64?cb=20150527013007\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>My parents?<div style=\"clear:both; margin:0; padding:0;\"></div>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/Tia\" title=\"Tia\"><img alt=\"TiaDialogue\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"TiaDialogue.png\" data-image-key=\"TiaDialogue.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/potionmaker/images/8/8f/TiaDialogue.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/64?cb=20150527013536\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>Ah yes. I'm here to speak with the store owner.<div style=\"clear:both; margin:0; padding:0;\"></div>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/Pio\" title=\"Pio\"><img alt=\"PiaDialogue\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"PiaDialogue.png\" data-image-key=\"PiaDialogue.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/potionmaker/images/6/67/PiaDialogue.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/64?cb=20150527013007\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>Ah, if that's the case I'm the owner of this store.<div style=\"clear:both; margin:0; padding:0;\"></div>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/Tia\" title=\"Tia\"><img alt=\"TiaDialogue\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"TiaDialogue.png\" data-image-key=\"TiaDialogue.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/potionmaker/images/8/8f/TiaDialogue.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/64?cb=20150527013536\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>What? You shouldn't tease adults! I will wait here until they come back.<div style=\"clear:both; margin:0; padding:0;\"></div>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/Tia\" title=\"Tia\"><img alt=\"TiaDialogue\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"TiaDialogue.png\" data-image-key=\"TiaDialogue.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/potionmaker/images/8/8f/TiaDialogue.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/64?cb=20150527013536\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>Please tell them \"a potion tradesmen from the palace has arrived\"<sup><abbr title=\"The preceding text has been transcribed exactly as presented in the original source.\" style=\"border-bottom: 1px dotted; cursor: help;\">&#91;<i>sic</i>&#93;</abbr></sup><div style=\"clear:both; margin:0; padding:0;\"></div>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/Pio\" title=\"Pio\"><img alt=\"PiaDialogue\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"PiaDialogue.png\" data-image-key=\"PiaDialogue.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/potionmaker/images/6/67/PiaDialogue.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/64?cb=20150527013007\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>Umm...ah, well...<div style=\"clear:both; margin:0; padding:0;\"></div>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/Blackcat\" title=\"Blackcat\"><img alt=\"BlackcatDialogue\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"64\" height=\"53\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"BlackcatDialogue.png\" data-image-key=\"BlackcatDialogue.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/potionmaker/images/a/a8/BlackcatDialogue.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/64?cb=20150527014712\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>Hey there blonde lady. Pio is the owner of the store-meow.<div style=\"clear:both; margin:0; padding:0;\"></div>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/Tia\" title=\"Tia\"><img alt=\"TiaDialogue\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"TiaDialogue.png\" data-image-key=\"TiaDialogue.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/potionmaker/images/8/8f/TiaDialogue.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/64?cb=20150527013536\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>?! Wh..what!<br />The cat just talked?!<div style=\"clear:both; margin:0; padding:0;\"></div>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/Blackcat\" title=\"Blackcat\"><img alt=\"BlackcatDialogue\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"64\" height=\"53\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"BlackcatDialogue.png\" data-image-key=\"BlackcatDialogue.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/potionmaker/images/a/a8/BlackcatDialogue.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/64?cb=20150527014712\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>Hey now, don't be shocked-meow. So, why have you come-meow. Blonde lady..<div style=\"clear:both; margin:0; padding:0;\"></div>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/Tia\" title=\"Tia\"><img alt=\"TiaDialogue\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"TiaDialogue.png\" data-image-key=\"TiaDialogue.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/potionmaker/images/8/8f/TiaDialogue.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/64?cb=20150527013536\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>I'm not blonde lady! My name is 'Tia'! I am an elite graduate of the kingdom's potion academy.<div style=\"clear:both; margin:0; padding:0;\"></div>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/Blackcat\" title=\"Blackcat\"><img alt=\"BlackcatDialogue\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"64\" height=\"53\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"BlackcatDialogue.png\" data-image-key=\"BlackcatDialogue.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/potionmaker/images/a/a8/BlackcatDialogue.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/64?cb=20150527014712\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>That is not my concern-meow. You should tell the rest to Pio-meow.<div style=\"clear:both; margin:0; padding:0;\"></div>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/Pio\" title=\"Pio\"><img alt=\"PiaDialogue\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"PiaDialogue.png\" data-image-key=\"PiaDialogue.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/potionmaker/images/6/67/PiaDialogue.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/64?cb=20150527013007\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>Thanks Blackcat.<br />And yes, I'm the owner of the store, name is Pio. How may I help you?<div style=\"clear:both; margin:0; padding:0;\"></div>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/Tia\" title=\"Tia\"><img alt=\"TiaDialogue\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"TiaDialogue.png\" data-image-key=\"TiaDialogue.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/potionmaker/images/8/8f/TiaDialogue.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/64?cb=20150527013536\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>R..really, this kid is the owen..er?<br />Well then. The name's Tia. The palace has sent me to work here. Please to meet you.<div style=\"clear:both; margin:0; padding:0;\"></div>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/Blackcat\" title=\"Blackcat\"><img alt=\"BlackcatDialogue\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"64\" height=\"53\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"BlackcatDialogue.png\" data-image-key=\"BlackcatDialogue.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/potionmaker/images/a/a8/BlackcatDialogue.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/64?cb=20150527014712\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>In other words, a trainee-meow. And in a small shop like this..<div style=\"clear:both; margin:0; padding:0;\"></div>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/Tia\" title=\"Tia\"><img alt=\"TiaDialogue\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"TiaDialogue.png\" data-image-key=\"TiaDialogue.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/potionmaker/images/8/8f/TiaDialogue.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/64?cb=20150527013536\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>Hey!<br />A person like me does not need training! I..I'm an elite graduate!<div style=\"clear:both; margin:0; padding:0;\"></div>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/Tia\" title=\"Tia\"><img alt=\"TiaDialogue\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"TiaDialogue.png\" data-image-key=\"TiaDialogue.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/potionmaker/images/8/8f/TiaDialogue.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/64?cb=20150527013536\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>There has been some misunderstanding, but I'm Tia! I'll show the palace they've made a terrible mistake.<div style=\"clear:both; margin:0; padding:0;\"></div>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/Pio\" title=\"Pio\"><img alt=\"PiaDialogue\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"PiaDialogue.png\" data-image-key=\"PiaDialogue.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/potionmaker/images/6/67/PiaDialogue.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/64?cb=20150527013007\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>Ah, the letter I received a couple days ago..this must have been about you!<br />I accidently<sup><abbr title=\"The preceding text has been transcribed exactly as presented in the original source.\" style=\"border-bottom: 1px dotted; cursor: help;\">&#91;<i>sic</i>&#93;</abbr></sup> dropped in a cauldron so I couldn't read it.<div style=\"clear:both; margin:0; padding:0;\"></div>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/Pio\" title=\"Pio\"><img alt=\"PiaDialogue\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"PiaDialogue.png\" data-image-key=\"PiaDialogue.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/potionmaker/images/6/67/PiaDialogue.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/64?cb=20150527013007\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>I was in need of some help!<br />Welcome!<div style=\"clear:both; margin:0; padding:0;\"></div>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/Tia\" title=\"Tia\"><img alt=\"TiaDialogue\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"TiaDialogue.png\" data-image-key=\"TiaDialogue.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/potionmaker/images/8/8f/TiaDialogue.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/64?cb=20150527013536\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>Well, thank you!<br />You may call me sister Tia!<div style=\"clear:both; margin:0; padding:0;\"></div>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/Pushcat\" title=\"Pushcat\"><img alt=\"PushcatDialogue\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"64\" height=\"46\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"PushcatDialogue.png\" data-image-key=\"PushcatDialogue.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/potionmaker/images/1/1a/PushcatDialogue.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/64?cb=20150527014149\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>Meow? Seems like Pio is more like an older sis-meow?<div style=\"clear:both; margin:0; padding:0;\"></div>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/Pio\" title=\"Pio\"><img alt=\"PiaDialogue\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"PiaDialogue.png\" data-image-key=\"PiaDialogue.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/potionmaker/images/6/67/PiaDialogue.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/64?cb=20150527013007\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>Hehe...well, the night is getting late you<sup><abbr title=\"The preceding text has been transcribed exactly as presented in the original source.\" style=\"border-bottom: 1px dotted; cursor: help;\">&#91;<i>sic</i>&#93;</abbr></sup> should come in and unpack.<div style=\"clear:both; margin:0; padding:0;\"></div>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<div align=\"center\">~ A new character 'Tia' has been unlocked ~</div>\n</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<table class=\"navtemplate\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"background:#660099\" colspan=\"2\">Characters\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th width=\"65px\" style=\"background:#ddd\">Protagonists\n</th>\n<td style=\"background:#dd\"><a href=\"/wiki/Pio\" title=\"Pio\">Pio</a> • <strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Tia</strong>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th width=\"65px\" style=\"background:#ddd\"><a href=\"/wiki/Travelers\" title=\"Travelers\">Travelers</a>\n</th>\n<td style=\"background:#dd\"><a href=\"/wiki/Tirami\" title=\"Tirami\">Tirami</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Neet\" title=\"Neet\">Neet</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Luke\" title=\"Luke\">Luke</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Claire\" title=\"Claire\">Claire</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Dolbur\" title=\"Dolbur\">Dolbur</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Piria\" title=\"Piria\">Piria</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Demian\" title=\"Demian\">Demian</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Charlotte\" title=\"Charlotte\">Charlotte</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Daisy\" title=\"Daisy\">Daisy</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Kyle\" title=\"Kyle\">Kyle</a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261012235145\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.041 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.071 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 170/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2856/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 94/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensiv